	key[]: "aca_scenario_book1_3_19_desc"
	val[]: "The final exam awaits you, where all the skills you've learned from the previous scenarios will be put to the test. We'll take a drive around the entire training centre to see how well you've learned the situations you've encountered so far.<br><br>Once you've completed all sections and manoeuvres, you'll be one step closer to calling yourself a skilled trucker!"

