#+ Book 3 Scenario urf
#@{

#### urf common
	key[]: "aca_scenario_book3_urf_title"
	val[]: "Backing Sandbox"

	key[]: "aca_scenario_book3_urf_desc"
	val[]: "In this scenario, you'll be put into a empty parking lot to practise reversing with doubles."

#### urf goal

	key[]: "aca_goal_book3_urf_start"
	val[]: "Getting Started"

	key[]: "aca_goal_book3_urf_move"
	val[]: "Experimenting"

	key[]: "aca_goal_book3_urf_stop"
	val[]: "Finishing Up"

	key[]: "aca_goal_book3_urf_end"
	val[]: "Ending the Scenario"

	#### urf msg - intro text

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_urf_cutscene1"
	val[]: "Reversing with doubles takes a lot more attention than with a single trailer. You need to plan ahead for where you want the rear trailer to go, while still keeping a handle on the lead trailer and cab. <br><br>Think of it this way - you must use the lead trailer to steer the rear trailer."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_urf_cutscene2"
	val[]: "In this case, we want to turn the rear trailer to the driver's side. To steer it this way, we need to push the front of the rear trailer to the passenger's side. <br><br>Notice that it essentially means that you must turn the lead trailer the opposite way you want to steer the rear trailer."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_urf_cutscene3"
	val[]: "Once the rear trailer starts turning, it is essential to straighten the tractor with the lead trailer. This is where most people often make their first mistake."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_urf_cutscene4"
	val[]: "Here we see the driver has failed to follow the lead, and is about to jack-knife his trailers."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_urf_cutscene5"
	val[]: "Jack-knifing occurs when the angle between any two vehicles in the combination becomes around 90-degrees. Once this happens, there is no saving it - you must pull forward and make another attempt. <br><br> As with reversing one trailer, the goal should always ensure all the wheels on the trailers are moving. One wheels come to a stop and the trailer is turning in place, you can not continue."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_urf_cutscene6"
	val[]: "You can pull forward to where you were last correct, or rather, a position where you can continue working in reverse without getting into the same error again. <br><br>In this case, we will pull forward to a straight position and try again from the beginning."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_urf_cutscene7"
	val[]: "Once again, as the rear trailer starts turning, get the tractor in front of the lead and let the rear trailer turn on its own for a moment."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_urf_cutscene8"
	val[]: "Now that the rear trailer is turning to where we want it to go, it is time to steer the lead to follow it. You can adjust the angle between the lead and the rear to control the turn and make it sharper or wider."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_urf_cutscene9"
	val[]: "The final part of the manoeuvre is straightening everything out. Get the lead lined up with the rear."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_urf_cutscene10"
	val[]: "You should keep in mind the amount of time it will take to move the lead trailer, if you wait too long the rear trailer will end up trying to go back where you just came from!"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_urf_cutscene11"
	val[]: "Feel free to spend as much time here as you want, experiment with different manoeuvres until you think you have a rough idea of how to manipulate the trailers in reverse. <br><br>But most importantly, remember to have fun with it!"

#### urf Driving Instructions

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_urf_start"
	val[]: "Prepare to set off."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_urf_move"
	val[]: "Use this parking lot to get a feel for handling the trailers in reverse. <br><br>@@aca_goal_tip@@ New to backing trailers in general? Consider playing Truck Driving Basics."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_urf_stop"
	val[]: "Take as long as you want to practise. <br><br>When you are satisfied, you can stop and secure the truck to end the scenario."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_urf_end"
	val[]: "Ugasite motor kako biste završili scenarij."
#@}


#+ Book 3 Scenario sup
#@{

#### sup common
	key[]: "aca_scenario_book3_sup_title"
	val[]: "Parkiranje na uskom mjestu"

	key[]: "aca_scenario_book3_sup_desc"
	val[]: "In this scenario, you're tasked with parking a set of doubles in a narrow space."

#### sup goal

	key[]: "aca_goal_book3_sup_start"
	val[]: "Početak rada"

	key[]: "aca_goal_book3_sup_forward"
	val[]: "Polazak"

	key[]: "aca_goal_book3_sup_check1"
	val[]: "Nastavite vožnju"

	key[]: "aca_goal_book3_sup_stop"
	val[]: "Zaustavljanje"

	key[]: "aca_goal_book3_sup_end"
	val[]: "Osiguravanje vozila"

#### sup msg - intro text

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_sup_cutscene1"
	val[]: "Vožnja s dvostrukim prikolicama može se činiti zastrašujućom, ali ne puno više od vožnje s jednom prikolicom - samo morate uzeti u obzir i put stražnje prikolice!"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_sup_cutscene2"
	val[]: "Ispred vas je usko parkirno mjesto. Nećete imati dovoljno prostora da se savršeno ispravite prije ulaska, pa ćete morati pažljivo razmisliti kako ćete ući s obje prikolice."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_sup_cutscene3"
	val[]: "Odmah skrenite prema drugoj strani parkirnog mjesta i vozite daleko dalje od mjesta gdje biste inače skrenuli."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_sup_cutscene4"
	val[]: "Sada kada je vaša stražnja prikolica na pravom putu, možete krenuti prema mjestu; samo pazite da ponovno krenete prema drugoj strani kako biste pomogli dovesti prvu prikolicu."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_sup_cutscene5"
	val[]: "Nastavite prema mjestu, a obje prikolice će vas pratiti i ispraviti se dok idete."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_sup_cutscene6"
	val[]: "Parkirajte na predviđenom području i osigurajte kamion."

#### sup Driving Instructions

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_sup_start"
	val[]: "Pripremite se za polazak."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_sup_forward"
	val[]: "Proceed forward and and into the narrow space."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_sup_check1"
	val[]: "Nastavite vožnju."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_sup_stop"
	val[]: "Zaustavite se u označenom području."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_sup_end"
	val[]: "Osigurajte kamion i ugasite motor."
#@}


