	val[]: "Well, once again someone has become frustrated and left their rig in the middle of the lot."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_correcting_90_cutscene2"
	val[]: "Now that you've backed up a few trailers, you should have a good idea of how to proceed from here."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_correcting_90_cutscene3"
	val[]: "Start by pulling forward until you have something to work with."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_correcting_90_cutscene4"
	val[]: "From here, you can now steer the rear trailer into the spot using the lead. Try to keep a nice arch through the combination so that everything keeps moving."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_correcting_90_cutscene5"
	val[]: "Takes as much time and as many corrections as you need."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_correcting_90_cutscene6"
