	val[]: "@@aca_goal_book3_sup_forward@@"
#!}
#### parallel msg - intro text

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_parallel_cutscene1"
	val[]: "Proceed around the corner and onto the roadway. You'll find an open spot for you there."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_parallel_cutscene2"
	val[]: "Pull into the parking spot, and drive through it; this will help get your trailers closer to where you need to be."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_parallel_cutscene3"
	val[]: "Continue out of the parking spot, and pull forward far enough that you have room to manoeuvre."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_parallel_cutscene4"
	val[]: "Using your lead trailer to steer, push your rear trailer into the spot. You will really need to plan ahead to ensure each trailer ends up where you want it."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_parallel_cutscene5"
	val[]: "You may have to pull forwards and backwards a few times to get everything where you want it."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_parallel_cutscene6"
	val[]: "Once you are satisfied that you are lined up with the edge of the road, centre the combination in the parking spot, and secure the vehicle."

#### parallel Driving Instructions

